# PROJECT: BUILD AN AI-POWERED ADVERTISING WORKSPACE

Act as a Senior SaaS Product Architect, UI/UX Designer, Full-Stack Developer, AI Agent Engineer and Performance Marketing Technology Specialist.

I want you to build a premium, production-oriented SaaS application called **AI Ads Workspace**.

This is not a traditional advertising dashboard. It is an AI-powered advertising operating system where advertisers can manage their advertising activities through natral-language prompts.

The platform should initially support Meta Ads and be architected to support Google Ads.

The primary AI engine will be Claude.

The system must combine:

1. Advertising Dashboard
2. Campaign Manager
3. AI Advertising Agent
4. Campaign Audit Agent
5. Strategy Agent
6. Budget Optimization Agent
7. Creative Intelligence Agent
8. Reporting Agent
9. Automation Centre
10. MCP Integration Layer

