# 16\. DEVELOPMENT RULES

Build this project in stages.

Stage 1:
Build the UI foundation, navigation, responsive layouts, authentication and database.

Stage 2:
Build the Meta OAuth integration and data synchronization.

Stage 3:
Build Meta MCP tools.

Stage 4:
Integrate Claude AI.

Stage 5:
Build campaign management and execution.

Stage 6:
Build audit, strategy and optimization agents.

Stage 7:
Build reporting and automation.

Stage 8:
Add Google Ads integration.

Important:

- Do not build everything in one unstructured code file.
- Use reusable React components.
- Create typed API interfaces.
- Keep business logic out of UI components.
- Never hardcode live advertising metrics.
- Never expose API secrets.
- Do not claim integrations work without actual API verification.
- Test all write operations.
- Maintain tenant isolation.
- Provide clear error states.
- Make the application mobile responsive.

Start by analysing the project, producing the architecture and implementing Stage 1.

Do not skip the database and security foundations.
